{"id":"n87589-1-9","stage":4,"title":"화자 · 说话者","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87589-1-9-1","ko":"언제 존대말을 써야 하는 것이죠?","zh":"什么时候需要用敬语呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언제","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"존대말을","meaning":"敬语","explanation":"존대말：敬语；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"존대말","audio":"/audio/8d1233a7c9158a4b80f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:존대말:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"존대말","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"써야","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것이죠?","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不知道的某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"8d1233a7c9158a4b","term":"존대말","zh":"敬语","audio":"/audio/8d1233a7c9158a4b80f1.mp3","definition":"为表示尊重对方或所谈及的人而使用的话语形式。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]}],"audio":"/audio/ae476f3df6af07198beb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87589-1-9-2","ko":"보통 화자보다 청자의 나이가 많을 때죠.","zh":"通常是在听话人的年龄比说话人大的时候。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"보통","meaning":"普通，一般","explanation":"보통：普通，一般","readings":[{"term":"보통","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65572","senseId":"1","lemma":"보통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화자보다","meaning":"说话者","explanation":"화자：说话者；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"화자","audio":"/audio/1f92b51edab492665902.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87589","senseId":"1","lemma":"화자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"청자의","meaning":"听者","explanation":"청자：听者；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"청자","audio":"/audio/e418f9cb4699cbaed9f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79323","senseId":"1","lemma":"청자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나이가","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많을","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때죠.","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"666599febd987f53","term":"보통","zh":"普通，一般","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3","entryId":"65572","definition":"一般性地；或指通常。","pronunciation":["보ː통"]},{"id":"1f92b51edab49266","term":"화자","zh":"说话者","audio":"/audio/1f92b51edab492665902.mp3","entryId":"87589","definition":"说话的人。","pronunciation":["화자"]},{"id":"e418f9cb4699cbae","term":"청자","zh":"听者","audio":"/audio/e418f9cb4699cbaed9f2.mp3","entryId":"79323","definition":"聆听者。","pronunciation":["청자"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]}],"audio":"/audio/e4ba96eaed16f20b663b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87589","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["什么时候需要用敬语呢？","通常是在听话人的年龄比说话人大的时候。","能借点火吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["什么时候需要用敬语呢？","通常是在听话人的年龄比说话人大的时候。","能借点火吗？"],"answer":1}]}
